{"case_id":"g8ctx003","case_type":"previous_concept_reference","execution_status":"COMPLETED","judgement":{"no_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["缓存空值","缓存穿透","不存在","短"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true},"with_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["缓存空值","缓存穿透","不存在","短"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true}},"no_history":{"answer":"缓存穿透是指查询数据库中不存在的数据，请求会直接打到数据库。参考资料提出了两种缓解方案：\n\n1. **布隆过滤器**：将所有可能存在的数据哈希到一个足够大的 bitmap 中，当查询一个一定不存在的 key 时，会被这个 bitmap 拦截，从而避免请求到达数据库 [C1]。\n\n2. **缓存空值**：如果查询返回的数据为空，仍然把空结果缓存起来（但设置较短的过期时间），这样后续相同的查询会命中缓存，而不会穿透到数据库 [C1]。","context":{"history_messages_received":0,"history_messages_used":0,"history_tokens_used":0,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":false},"latency_ms":5512.69,"planner":{"action":"single_retrieval","query_type":"unknown"},"route":{"reason_code":"PLANNER_FALLBACK","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"single_retrieval","router_policy_version":"adaptive_retrieval_policy_v1","strategy_reason_code":"PLANNER_FALLBACK_BM25"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"e5df974c3f9206210bce346f8fe68840","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"unknown","rank":1,"score":0.016393,"source":"D:/学习/rag实战项目/测试类/测试文档_多主题.md"},{"chunk_id":"65becc73c32e56f06662e106879e5889","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"unknown","rank":2,"score":0.016129,"source":"D:/学习/rag实战项目/测试类/测试文档_多主题.md"},{"chunk_id":"33a423c738872551017daa6ebb15a97b","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"unknown","rank":3,"score":0.015873,"source":"D:/学习/rag实战项目/测试类/测试文档_多主题.md"},{"chunk_id":"32893b54d6246c78c92a8770c30657e7","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"unknown","rank":4,"score":0.015625,"source":"D:/学习/rag实战项目/测试类/测试文档_多主题.md"},{"chunk_id":"doc_0","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":null,"rank":5,"score":0.015385,"source":"C:\\Users\\TUM